><span begin="27.580" end="27.740">ery</span> <span begin="27.740" end="28.020">night</span> <span begin="28.020" end="28.170">I</span> <span begin="28.170" end="28.510">go</span> <span begin="28.510" end="29.990">stow</span> <span begin="29.990" end="30.180">a</span><span begin="30.180" end="31.130">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今每逢夜幕我便躲藏</span></p><p begin="31.430" end="34.940" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.430" end="31.660">Hide</span> <span begin="31.660" end="31.910">from</span> <span begin="31.910" end="31.990">the</span> <span begin="31.990" end="32.600">mobs</span> <span begin="32.600" end="32.920">I</span> <span begin="32.920" end="33.410">used</span> <span begin="33.410" end="33.480">to</span> <span begin="33.480" end="34.940">slay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逃避那些曾被我斩杀的怪物</span></p><p begin="48.360" end="52.180" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.360" end="48.630">They</span> <span begin="48.630" end="49.050">once</span> <span begin="49.050" end="49.370">were</span> <span begin="49.370" end="50.790">ter</span><span begin="50.790" end="50.930">ri</span><span begin="50.930" end="52.180">fied</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它们曾经惊恐万分</span></p><p begin="52.580" end="55.470" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.580" end="52.790">Ev</span><span begin="52.790" end="52.930">ery</span> <span begin="52.930" end="53.250">time</span> <span begin="53.250" end="53.440">I</span> <span begin="53.440" end="53.870">looked</span> <span begin="53.870" end="54.040">in</span><span begin="54.040" end="54.300">to</span> <span begin="54.300" end="54.570">their</span> <span begin="54.570" end="55.470">eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当我凝视它们的双眼</span></p><p begin="55.470" end="59.120" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.470" end="55.810">Vil</span><span begin="55.810" end="55.980">la</span><span begin="55.980" end="56.230">gers</span> <span begin="56.230" end="56.390">would</span> <span begin="56.390" end="57.770">cheer</span> <span begin="57.770" end="58.000">my</span> <span begin="58.000" end="59.120">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">村民们夹道为我欢呼</span></p><p begin="59.430" end="1:02.250" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.430" end="59.770">For</span> <span begin="59.770" end="59.890">a</span> <span begin="59.890" end="1:00.220">he</span><span begin="1:00.220" end="1:00.400">ro</span> <span begin="1:00.400" end="1:00.580">I</span> <span begin="1:00.580" end="1:01.070">was,</span> <span begin="1:01.070" end="1:01.510">that&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:01.510" end="1:01.680">what</span> <span begin="1:01.680" end="1:01.860">they&apos;d</span> <span begin="1:01.860" end="1:02.250">say</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们都说我是一位英雄</span></p><p begin="1:02.360" end="1:06.080" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.360" end="1:02.560">One</span> <span begin="1:02.560" end="1:02.800">min</span><span begin="1:02.800" end="1:03.010">ute</span> <span begin="1:03.010" end="1:03.390">we</span> <span begin="1:03.390" end="1:04.780">had</span> <span begin="1:04.780" end="1:04.940">it</span> <span begin="1:04.940" end="1:06.080">all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前一刻我们还拥有一切</span></p><p begin="1:06.410" end="1:08.920" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.410" end="1:06.740">Next</span> <span begin="1:06.740" end="1:06.880">our</span> <span begin="1:06.880" end="1:07.580">world</span> <span begin="1:07.580" end="1:07.740">be</span><span begin="1:07.740" end="1:08.230">gan</span> <span begin="1:08.230" end="1:08.320">to</span> <span begin="1:08.320" end="1:08.920">fall</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">转瞬间世界便开始崩塌</span></p><p begin="1:08.920" end="1:13.040" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.920" end="1:09.040">A</span><span begin="1:09.040" end="1:09.260">way</span> <span begin="1:09.260" end="1:09.570">from</span> <span begin="1:09.570" end="1:09.780">all</span> <span begin="1:09.780" end="1:10.030">that</span> <span begin="1:10.030" end="1:10.200">it</span> <span begin="1:10.200" end="1:10.340">had</span> <span begin="1:10.340" end="1:11.650">once</span> <span begin="1:11.650" end="1:11.860">be</span><span begin="1:11.860" end="1:13.040">come</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">昔日建起的一切渐渐消散</span></p><p begin="1:13.340" end="1:16.620" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.340" end="1:13.630">They</span> <span begin="1:13.630" end="1:13.790">all</span> <span begin="1:13.790" end="1:14.080">cried</span> <span begin="1:14.080" end="1:14.280">for</span> <span begin="1:14.280" end="1:14.510">my</span> <span begin="1:14.510" end="1:14.950">help,</span> <span begin="1:14.950" end="1:15.200">but</span> <span begin="1:15.200" end="1:15.330">I</span> <span begin="1:15.330" end="1:15.610">stood</span> <span begin="1:15.610" end="1:15.790">there</span> <span begin="1:15.790" end="1:16.620">numb</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们呼喊我去救援 我却麻木地伫立</span></p><p begin="1:17.080" end="1:20.680" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.080" end="1:17.200">I</span> <span begin="1:17.200" end="1:17.800">gaze</span> <span begin="1:17.800" end="1:18.220">off</span> <span begin="1:18.220" end="1:18.380">in</span><span begin="1:18.380" end="1:18.630">to</span> <span begin="1:18.630" end="1:18.760">the</span> <span begin="1:18.760" end="1:19.510">bound</span><span begin="1:19.510" end="1:19.650">less</span> <span begin="1:19.650" end="1:20.160">sky</span><span begin="1:20.160" end="1:20.680">line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我遥望那无垠的天际</span></p><p begin="1:20.810" end="1:24.180" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.810" end="1:21.200">Note</span> <span begin="1:21.200" end="1:21.600">block</span> <span begin="1:21.600" end="1:21.930">choirs</span> <span begin="1:21.930" end="1:22.200">play</span><span begin="1:22.200" end="1:22.390">ing</span> <span begin="1:22.390" end="1:22.990">in</span> <span begin="1:22.990" end="1:23.100">the</span> <span begin="1:23.100" end="1:23.570">sun</span><span begin="1:23.570" end="1:24.180">shine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">音符盒的合唱在阳光下奏响</span></p><p begin="1:24.190" end="1:27.610" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.190" end="1:24.540">Turn</span> <span begin="1:24.540" end="1:24.630">a</span><span begin="1:24.630" end="1:25.130">round,</span> <span begin="1:25.130" end="1:25.390">pick</span> <span begin="1:25.390" end="1:25.540">up</span> <span begin="1:25.540" end="1:25.680">my</span> <span begin="1:25.680" end="1:26.540">sword</span> <span begin="1:26.540" end="1:26.710">and</span> <span begin="1:26.710" end="1:27.610">wield</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">转过身来拾起长剑 挥动</span></p><p begin="1:27.610" end="1:31.080" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.610" end="1:27.740">The</span> <span begin="1:27.740" end="1:28.040">blade</span> <span begin="1:28.040" end="1:28.200">that</span> <span begin="1:28.200" end="1:28.610">once</span> <span begin="1:28.610" end="1:28.940">forced</span> <span begin="1:28.940" end="1:29.240">evil</span> <span begin="1:29.240" end="1:29.930">mobs</span> <span begin="1:29.930" end="1:30.170">to</span> <span begin="1:30.170" end="1:31.080">yield</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那曾令邪恶怪物屈服的锋刃</span></p><p begin="1:31.080" end="1:34.280" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.080" end="1:31.200">And</span> <span begin="1:31.200" end="1:31.640">hope</span> <span begin="1:31.640" end="1:32.060">one</span> <span begin="1:32.060" end="1:32.340">day</span> <span begin="1:32.340" end="1:32.530">that</span> <span begin="1:32.530" end="1:32.740">this</span> <span begin="1:32.740" end="1:33.230">cha</span><span begin="1:33.230" end="1:33.670">os</sp