"2:00.570">le</span><span begin="2:00.570" end="2:01.740">tons</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">苦力怕和骷髅来袭</span></p><p begin="2:01.920" end="2:04.500" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.920" end="2:02.100">Blew</span> <span begin="2:02.100" end="2:02.400">down</span> <span begin="2:02.400" end="2:02.480">the</span> <span begin="2:02.480" end="2:03.230">doors</span> <span begin="2:03.230" end="2:03.420">and</span> <span begin="2:03.420" end="2:03.910">boxed</span> <span begin="2:03.910" end="2:04.120">us</span> <span begin="2:04.120" end="2:04.500">in</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">炸开大门 将我们团团围困</span></p><p begin="2:04.700" end="2:08.670" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.700" end="2:04.960">Ar</span><span begin="2:04.960" end="2:05.140">rows</span> <span begin="2:05.140" end="2:05.300">whiz</span><span begin="2:05.300" end="2:05.580">zing</span> <span begin="2:05.580" end="2:05.770">by</span> <span begin="2:05.770" end="2:05.950">like</span> <span begin="2:05.950" end="2:07.410">streaks</span> <span begin="2:07.410" end="2:07.540">of</span> <span begin="2:07.540" end="2:08.670">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">利箭呼啸而过 宛如道道流光</span></p><p begin="2:08.960" end="2:12.020" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.960" end="2:09.210">I</span> <span begin="2:09.210" end="2:09.520">tried</span> <span begin="2:09.520" end="2:09.720">all</span> <span begin="2:09.720" end="2:09.960">that</span> <span begin="2:09.960" end="2:10.040">I</span> <span begin="2:10.040" end="2:10.530">could</span> <span begin="2:10.530" end="2:10.630">to</span> <span begin="2:10.630" end="2:11.210">stay</span> <span begin="2:11.210" end="2:11.410">and</span> <span begin="2:11.410" end="2:12.020">fight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我竭尽全力留下战斗</span></p><p begin="2:12.100" end="2:15.930" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.100" end="2:12.340">As</span> <span begin="2:12.340" end="2:12.610">the</span> <span begin="2:12.610" end="2:12.780">un</span><span begin="2:12.780" end="2:12.930">dead</span> <span begin="2:12.930" end="2:14.350">roamed</span> <span begin="2:14.350" end="2:14.400">the</span> <span begin="2:14.400" end="2:15.930">street</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亡灵在街巷徘徊</span></p><p begin="2:15.920" end="2:18.560" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.920" end="2:16.260">Fam</span><span begin="2:16.260" end="2:16.410">i</span><span begin="2:16.410" end="2:16.850">lies</span> <span begin="2:16.850" end="2:17.120">bro</span><span begin="2:17.120" end="2:17.360">ken</span> <span begin="2:17.360" end="2:17.700">at</span> <span begin="2:17.700" end="2:17.870">my</span> <span begin="2:17.870" end="2:18.560">feet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">支离破碎的家庭倒在我脚边</span></p><p begin="2:18.560" end="2:22.700" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.560" end="2:18.880">Life</span> <span begin="2:18.880" end="2:18.980">it</span><span begin="2:18.980" end="2:19.260">self</span> <span begin="2:19.260" end="2:19.470">sus</span><span begin="2:19.470" end="2:19.710">pen</span><span begin="2:19.710" end="2:19.890">ded</span> <span begin="2:19.890" end="2:21.240">by</span> <span begin="2:21.240" end="2:21.350">a</span> <span begin="2:21.350" end="2:22.700">thread</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生命悬于一线</span></p><p begin="2:23.240" end="2:25.860" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.240" end="2:23.380">Oh,</span> <span begin="2:23.380" end="2:23.640">why</span> <span begin="2:23.640" end="2:23.890">was</span> <span begin="2:23.890" end="2:24.090">it</span> <span begin="2:24.090" end="2:24.320">that</span> <span begin="2:24.320" end="2:24.500">I</span> <span begin="2:24.500" end="2:24.920">wasn&apos;t</span> <span begin="2:24.920" end="2:25.860">dead?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 为何死去的不是我？</span></p><p begin="2:26.530" end="2:30.340" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.530" end="2:26.760">I</span> <span begin="2:26.760" end="2:27.360">gaze</span> <span begin="2:27.360" end="2:27.780">off</span> <span begin="2:27.780" end="2:27.940">in</span><span begin="2:27.940" end="2:28.200">to</span> <span begin="2:28.200" end="2:28.320">the</span> <span begin="2:28.320" end="2:29.070">bound</span><span begin="2:29.070" end="2:29.210">less</span> <span begin="2:29.210" end="2:29.720">sky</span><span begin="2:29.720" end="2:30.340">line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我遥望那无边的天际</span></p><p begin="2:30.340" end="2:33.780" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:30.340" end="2:30.790">Note</span> <span begin="2:30.790" end="2:31.170">block</span> <span begin="2:31.170" end="2:31.520">choirs</span> <span begin="2:31.520" end="2:31.770">play</span><span begin="2:31.770" end="2:31.970">ing</span> <span begin="2:31.970" end="2:32.580">in</span> <span begin="2:32.580" end="2:32.660">the</span> <span begin="2:32.660" end="2:33.140">sun</span><span begin="2:33.140" end="2:33.780">shine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">音符盒的合唱在阳光下奏响</span></p><p begin="2:33.780" end="2:37.180" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.780" end="2:34.100">Turn</span> <span begin="2:34.100" end="2:34.200">a</span><span begin="2:34.200" end="2:34.690">round,</span> <span begin="2:34.690" end="2:34.950">pick</span> <span begin="2:34.950" end="2:35.110">up</span> <span begin="2:35.110" end="2:35.250">my</span> <span begin="2:35.250" end="2:36.100">sword</span> <span begin="2:36.100" end="2:36.270">and</span> <span begin="2:36.270" end="2:37.180">wield</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">转身拾起长剑 再次挥动</span></p><p begin="2:37.170" end="2:40.540" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.170" end="2:37.270">The</span> <span begin="2:37.270" end="2:37.600">blade</span> <span begin="2:37.600" end="2:37.76